        "raw": "<p>It's probably too late for me to get it ready by tomorrow (where I might need it) but that shouldn't discourage me starting a translation.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>As you don't really need more than the rules infos on the character booklets it shouldn't be that much to do.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>But if anyone has already done some translations for their own groups please let me know.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Current plan:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>- Translate rule section</p>\r\n\r\n<p>- Translate booklets of Legacy, Wraith, Tachyon, Absolute Zero</p>\r\n\r\n<p>- Translate booklets of Bunker and Unity (more things to translate)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I'll keep you posted on my progress.</p>",
